# =============================================================================
# PoggioAI/MSc Environment Variables
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in any optional service keys:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored — your local copy won't be committed.
#
# --- CLI Agent Tools (no API keys needed) ---
# LLM access is provided via CLI agent tools (claude, codex, gemini).
# These tools authenticate through their own subscriptions
# (Claude Max, ChatGPT Pro, Gemini Advanced, etc.) — no API keys required.
#
# Verify your CLI tools are installed:
#   which claude    # Anthropic Claude CLI
#   which codex     # OpenAI Codex CLI
#   which gemini    # Google Gemini CLI

# --- Search / Web Tools (optional) ---
# SERPER_API_KEY=your_serper_api_key_here
# SEARXNG_INSTANCE_URL=https://your-searxng-instance

# --- Tinker Mode (GPU training via Tinker API) ---
# TINKER_API_KEY=your_tinker_api_key_here

# --- GitHub Issues idea queue ---
# Fine-grained PAT with issues:write on your website repo
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here

# --- Website publishing (auto-publish completed research) ---
# WEBSITE_REPO_PATH=~/le-big-mac.github.io
# WEBSITE_DOMAIN=le-big-mac.github.io
# RESEARCH_SITE_REPO=~/le-big-mac.github.io
